# Plebian-OS 0.2.3 RC9 candidate environment.
#
# STATUS: This branch prepares RC9 on top of the frozen RC8 source line.
# PLEBIAN_OS_REF reserves v0.2.3-rc9; no candidate tag or image is created
# by this change. Cut and qualify the candidate before publishing it.
# Ask default is lfm2-kilix-v5e1-wse-20261106.9. Help default is
# kilix-qwen-sft1-2b. The optional qwen-0.8b-no-loop-02 chat model remains
# through kilix-llm. The image ships Paradee and en_core_web_sm, and
# PDF Conversion's PP-OCRv6 small page OCR models.
# Fresh-install, BIOS, and EFI acceptance of RC9 are
# not claimed. Image upgrade, standalone upgrade, rollback, and user-data
# preservation are not claimed here. Carrier 62d0c800 binds content
# db463a7 and licence 596ada2. Two seats reviewed carrier 62d0c800
# and both say ship with known issues. The kilix-diarization-cpu
# notice licensors match the licence-record string a receipt binds.
#
# Every component *_REF except PLEBIAN_OS_REF is a bare 40-character SHA.
# PLEBIAN_OS_REF is the intended candidate tag v0.2.3-rc9. The same *_REF values
# are mirrored in the closure table of releases/0.2.3-notes.md.
# Where a pin moved since 0.2.2 the comment above it says from what and to
# what. Where it did not move the comment says held.

# Numeric release with an intended RC9 candidate tag.
PLEBIAN_OS_VERSION=0.2.3
PLEBIAN_OS_RELEASE_MODE=1
# Local annotated RC9 tag. Not pushed. RC9 acceptance is not claimed.
PLEBIAN_OS_REF=v0.2.3-rc9
PLEBIAN_OS_REPO=https://github.com/itsmygithubacct/plebian-os.git
PLEBIAN_OS_BRANCH=
# Advanced from 0.2.2's 2dd44b003b1d0d0ca4b06aa2721467590b5f71f7.
# Advances 92c81c0 with the Debian Go installer and upgrade reconciliation.
PLEB_REF=49fc7554a01b30e33fd1a8f12e038906830bc7fe
PLEB_REPO=https://github.com/itsmygithubacct/pleb.git
PLEB_BRANCH=
# Advanced from 425695ed96045326e9dfaa1fe9ff8dfa1ace1bfd through f0f3639b71e91e08380517d55959cd9af202bbcb, which advanced from b77e49b37068a8fad7be110cad830c17407edbaa, f93c100cf2b3c17c6b0b9d0b5b8d310a63f47e05, e479a71fc7c6fab5847913726f3be825b5e30d80, 8128a11aed657ad78a87168ddd31d56d76cfff8e, 750d4e7bc839802c11bbb4908ef6efb05e9a846f, 5ea48af6c8a9fd507b8dda9ff021a111d68f5090, 97040d345874d30928ac9e221e36eb7ac563b00f and the published RC7 pin 55d7ea2ab00d83bd4ddeff674dee86cf7c5a8897. 8128a11 answers questions about Kilix itself in Ask. e479a71 reads multi-day forecasts and older app installs in Ask. b77e49b points the kilix-content gitlink at 32722d0be0e00974635ba3ab2ee9543fa35db92f, which catalogues PDF Conversion's PP-OCRv6 small page OCR models. f0f3639 answers questions Needle finds no job for with the catalog's qwen3.5-4b on the local Ollama, when the model sizer says it fits; the gitlink stays at 32722d0. b3719704 advances from f0f3639 and points KILIX_BONSAI_REF at 5fd3ef9571fd328a25edba7006d58ca8e5df6853, which checks out the pinned kilix-content gitlink before a Bonsai image model is admitted. 755f1123 advances from b3719704. Calling a model installs it on first use after its licence screen, and a decline installs nothing. KILIX_BONSAI_REF moves to 124d9a4e4ec47cdd4f2c07f038015df16c97a56b. 2cb82cf6 advances from 755f1123. Calling Paradee on a terminal installs paradee-8m-v1.2 after its licence screen when the image copy is absent. A decline installs nothing. The wizard's default-voice check stays a verify. fafc0a14 advances from 2cb82cf6 and points KILIX_BONSAI_REF at 48e18c7d8e8b4322813504953ecd928fdc0800e0. Calling Bonsai weights, a named Qwen voice, Female-02, YAMNet, YOLOX, Playalong, PDF conversion, or Pocket weights installs that model on first use after its licence screen. A decline installs nothing. Status, doctor, and listing stay read-only. The kilix-content gitlink stays at 32722d0.
# It pins kilix-llm 24292157f980fe574dbf66fdc2403e2f82129f00 (thinking stays off for qwen-0.8b-no-loop-02; pull of that id is refused; the runtime build does not fetch the web UI) and kilix-avatar 202f03cd2834c7979f9399d6e03caa823786d2dd.
# Ask answers a closed sum, the time, disk, memory, CPU, one sensor reading, volume, brightness, the network name, the current track, and an alarm directly. An integer sum prints in full, a conversion keeps its unit, and "and" is addition except inside one hundred. kilix ask --repl stays open until exit, quit, or EOF, including a final line with no newline. How-to search calls the installed help program. A wifi question uses wifi devices only. A temperature down to -100°C is a reading. Ask arithmetic reads a written thousand, million, or billion. The numeric keypad is injected into a private X app, so Chromium under kilix run receives it. Forecasts and saved-place weather are answered, and the page strip shows a weather emoji. The kilix-telemetry gitlink is ea35206cc0a2cfde422d1112a99d6245f55d57c6.
# Paradee af_heart is the fresh-install system voice, and install and synthesis check the Apache-2.0 text.
# dd4d8eda advances fafc0a14 with plain coding-pane close (engine 35730d17).
# The content gitlink advances to db463a7; broker 5ec6fb7 reaps stopped descendants on plain close.
# RC9 adds agent text delivery and disables thinking for the optional 0.8B chat model.
KILIX_REF=abf4c136b95d26b79acc10733ba8a3a192223c1f
KILIX_REPO=https://github.com/itsmygithubacct/kilix.git
KILIX_BRANCH=
